the Nineties think beauty was objective?</div> </div> </div> </div>Game design has advanced a lot in 20 years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T18:56:38-08:00","id":1361642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361631#post1361631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because appearance is subjective. Presence is not. Long story short, a person with high presence make you pay attention on her, no matter if you think she is beautiful or not, while high appearance is basically attractiveness.</div> </div> </div> </div>Part of it was the rebooting of the NWoD which also repackaged Appearance as Striking Looks, making it a modifier of Social rolls instead of a determiner. This was done to set up the idea of Force, Finesse and Resilience as approaches. You'll notice that Perception and Wits have also disappeared as full Attributes, being folded together into Cunning.<br /> <br /> These are some scenes from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gxxWfk4g-18\" target=\"_blank\"><i>The Simple Life's </i></a>first season starring famous &quot;hotties&quot; Paris Hilton and Nicole Richie. 2003-2004 Paris and Nicole are both really pretty girls. Watch that clip, listen to those very pretty, high-Appearance girls and then tell us all how much influence you'd let them exercise over your life.<br /> <br /> That's why Appearance was canned as an Attribute.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-17T19:03:22-08:00","id":1361644,"title":"","content":"Oh come with me my pretty little one<br /> Oh come with me my honey<br /> I swear by the blue eyes in my head<br /> That you\u2019ll never want for money...<br /> <br /> \u201cMy pretty little one.\u201d Not \u201cmy high-Presence little one.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T01:23:46-08:00","id":1361684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361634#post1361634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. Maybe. Some people might think pink and blue hair is beautiful, but someone else might disagree. Is that why you mean?</div> </div> </div> </div>Kind of... the example I used on my previous discussion was more like: Some people will put a extreme overweight girl as a 5 dot appearance, others will put this same as 1 dot, same for trans, same for different sex. A person with high presence can look like any one, their capacity is not necessary ally related to your preferences but they will make everyone pay attention on them, for their weirdness, sex appeal, way they move, voice, what ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T01:38:21-08:00","id":1361686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361641#post1361641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Game design has advanced a lot in 20 years.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly! One of the th ings that happened in the last 20 years was a way thinking about social attributes as important as the others, and ways to quantify it. Strength, Dexterity and Constitution are prety easy to quantify and differentiate, but Charisma was the black sheep in DnD.<br /> <br /> When it was turned on 3 attributes in VtM there was no discussion about how people do social things, not on a quantifiable way, so Appearance was the obvious choice of word to simplify the first look attractiveness. Play with the idea for 10 years and you have a more clear way to think about social interaction as mechanical process (like any other action) and you start using a more \u201cworks for all\u201d word, that is presence.<br /> <br /> i personally see this 3 arenas x 3 approaches as a natural evolution of the VtM attributes, of course a genial mind stepped and wrote it, but it was surfacing over the 1995-2005 period, before the New World of Darkness show up with the end of appearance as an attribute.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T04:58:53-08:00","id":1361709,"title":"","content":"@mateusluz my friend is kind of heavy and people still find her attractive, but usually only after she lets them see her boobs (except for the ones who actually like her like her).<br /> <br /> My point is, appearance is somewhat subjective, but it\u2019s still important. However, I do agree that it can be accurately represented by the Striking Looks merit. You don\u2019t need a whole separate attribute.<br /> <br /> Thanks for talking this out with me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T05:00:47-08:00","id":1361710,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24020-mateus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24020_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24020\" data-vbnamecard=\"24020\">Mateus</a> Luz","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T05:07:21-08:00","id":1361711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361644#post1361644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh come with me my pretty little one<br /> Oh come with me my honey<br /> I swear by the blue eyes in my head<br /> That you\u2019ll never want for money...<br /> <br /> \u201cMy pretty little one.\u201d Not \u201cmy high-Presence little one.\u201d</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep, My. Pretty <i>little</i> one. Who will never want for money.<br /> <br /> Does the blue-eyed person seem to be regarding the &quot;pretty little one&quot; with respect? Or as an equal? Because it doesn't sound like to to me.<br /> <br /> Will a person with really good looks but a low Presence/Manipulation be able to bed people all the live-long night? Probably so. Will they be able to get those people to say &quot;Yes&quot; to anything beyond variations of &quot;Wanna fuck?&quot; Probably not.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T05:13:10-08:00","id":1361714,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> shit. I never looked at it that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T09:44:57-08:00","id":1361752,"title":"","content":"Just getting way off on a tangent here, but the last time I saw something cool done with Appearance as an attribute was Exalted 2nd and Abyssals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\">Community Content Creator</a><a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Sean%20Creef\" target=\"_blank\"> - OPP Freelancer</a> - Storyguide / Storyteller<br /> Currently Running: Trinity Continuum Core, Vampire the Masquerade 5th Edition","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3331-tragedyjones","name":"tragedyjones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T12:15:31-08:00","id":1361777,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361752#post1361752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just getting way off on a tangent here, but the last time I saw something cool done with Appearance as an attribute was Exalted 2nd and Abyssals.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm curious as to why you would go to Ex2 and Abyssals as an example instead of, say, the setup that Ex3 and Adventure! use for Appearance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-18T17:48:26-08:00","id":1361821,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tragedyjones</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361752#post1361752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just getting way off on a tangent here, but the last time I saw something cool done with Appearance as an attribute was Exalted 2nd and Abyssals.</div> </div> </div> </div>The thing I remember from the previous version of Trinity is that Appearance was kind of... disposal. There was a 3 point physical Flaw called &quot;Disfigured&quot; which lowered your base Appearance to 0, but raised it to 5 for the purposes of Intimidation. And the NORCA can shapeshift. So a Biokinetic could take that &quot;Flaw&quot; and use Transformation to look like a supermodel until he wanted to scare the piss out of somebody, at which point he reverts to his butt-ugly self. So in one of the fundamental defining Attributes, you could skate by with a 0.<br /> <br /> But if you can skate by with a 0, that pretty much means that's not really a fundamental Attribute. Anybody want to play with a 0 Dex? 0 Str? How about a 0 Intelligence? No, not so much?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T17:57:56-08:00","id":1362027,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2318\" data-vbnamecard=\"2318\">johntfs</a> I thought about what you said.<br /> <br /> Do you agree that it would be helpful if someone with a high Presence and Manipulation score who wanted to convince another person to do something also had the Striking Looks merit?<br /> <br /> Also, \u201clittle\u201d in that song means short. Petite. He\u2019s not demeaning her.<br /> <br /> That being said, thank you. What you said above is the most useful advice I ever received on a gaming site.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-21T05:33:32-08:00","id":1362379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1358483-if-you-could-make-one-real-2018-celebrity-erupt-who-and-what-powers?p=1361627#post1361627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ariana Grande. No clue about the powers, except maybe some Mega-Social Attributes.</div> </div> </div> </div>The ability to grow cat ears, or at least take them as an aberration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-21T07:15:17-08:00","id":1362394,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8719\" data-vbnamecard=\"8719\">Florin</a> I love it!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https:/